Test data
---------
The fixtures test/fixtures/demo12_off_* and test/fixtures/*_unit_gams are
derived from the TIMES_Demo dataset (model demo12),
https://github.com/etsap-TIMES/TIMES_Demo at commit 962db86:

  Copyright (C) 2000-2023 IEA Energy Technology Systems Analysis Programme
  (ETSAP). Licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
  Public License (CC BY 4.0), https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/.
  The dataset is provided without warranty.

Changes: TIMES v4.9.7 was run on the dataset with GAMS, and the run's data,
coefficient, pre-solve, matrix and solution states were exported to Arrow and
JSON files (reference/python/make_reference.py, scripts/make_m11_fixture.jl,
scripts/make_m12_fixture.jl). The *_unit_gams fixtures run TIMES GAMS files on
demo12 states to which test/unit/*_case.jl adds records.
